1
00:00:00,557 --> 00:00:11,897
(Sheldon:)It's a trap.

2
00:00:33,632 --> 00:00:35,422
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

3
00:00:35,592 --> 00:00:37,222
(Howard(voice from inside):)Come.

4
00:00:37,552 --> 00:00:38,842
(Leonard:)Hey.

5
00:00:39,012 --> 00:00:41,432
(Sheldon:)Congratulations,
I see you did your laundry.

6
00:00:42,057 --> 00:00:43,097
(Penny:)Well, sort of.

7
00:00:43,266 --> 00:00:46,106
- How does one sort of...?
- I bought new clothes, okay?

8
00:00:47,187 --> 00:00:49,437
(Penny:)- Is Leonard around?
- He's upstairs at Alicia's.

9
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:52,070
(Penny:)Oh, all right, that's cool, no biggie.

10
00:00:52,275 --> 00:00:55,445
(Penny:)He said he'd help me set up my printer,
but I guess I can wait.

11
00:00:55,654 --> 00:00:57,114
What exactly is he doing there?

12
00:00:57,572 --> 00:01:00,612
(Sheldon:)In what I can only perceive
as a tactical move to destroy me...

